OL,3,CJersey and Guernsey record hottest
OL,4,Cmonth for third time in a row
OL,6,FMore temperature records have been
OL,7,Fbroken across the Channel Islands
OL,8,Fafter a prolonged spell of hot weather.
OL,10,FJersey and Guernsey both recorded
OL,11,Ftheir warmest July ever, beating
OL,12,Fprevious highs set in 1983, with
OL,13,Faverage temperatures of 21.3C and
OL,14,F19.5C respectively.
OL,16,FIt is the third consecutive month that
OL,17,Fboth islands have set a new average,
OL,18,Ffollowing further heatwaves in May and
OL,19,FJune.
OL,26,@uD@]OXvD@EOX
